  // places moved out of their stand-ins (Lurking Steel to the East Province's third area, False Dragon to Casseroya Lake).
  // Read after west.json (".json" sorts before "_north.json"), so its hills are laid over every earlier file's and its
  // floors cut them. Our own land, from public descriptions of the places and memory of play, nothing traced, at PD1's,
  // PD3's and PD6's compressed distances (docs/mechanics/rulings.md, "The North Province and the last three gyms"):
  // - north out of Medali along the North Province's first area to the foot of Glaseado Mountain, a valley at the
  //   ways' height under the mountain's south face; the mountain's snowslope climbs from the middle of the foot to its
  //   top, where Glaseado's gym and Pokémon Center stand 40 m over the valley, shut in on its sides by crags too steep to
  //   climb and higher than the top
  // - east along the foot to Montenevera in the snow, and on east through the East Province's third area, south to
  //   Levincia, with Lurking Steel's sandy cutting east off the third area
  // - Casseroya Lake in its hollow east off the North Province's first area, False Dragon's
  // - Alfornada west of Cortondo, through Alfornada Cavern, a tunnel cut through the hills between them (carve/alfornada.json)
